  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:37 AM",
      "text": "Are you okay??"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:41 AM",
      "text": "If I told you all the shit that’s going on right now and I said, “Honestly I am OK,” you wouldn’t believe me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:41 AM",
      "text": "But I’m ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:41 AM",
      "text": "I'm here"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "Yeah call me later I don’t really wanna talk about it via text but just put in your mind that the Tigers and Free Press worked together to get me off the beat"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "This is the Free Press’ fault"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "But Colangelo is trying to kill my story"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "As he should!"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "So I guess what I’m saying is, I’m sure there’s some people in there that might think differently about not talking with me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "If they knew that I”m getting removed from the beat"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "That's fucked"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "It’s not"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "Write a fucking blog post"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "You have the following"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "No that would be the stupidest thing in the history of the world"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "Because I’d get sued"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "This situation is not as bad as I’m painting it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Why"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Ugh.  All that work"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "This kind of story, the Freep is going to have to run through lawyers"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Ok what I don’t wanna talk about via text is *me*"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Holy fuck"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "But let me explain this more"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:47 AM",
      "text": "I sent the pizza because I do not want to cover the Tigers anymore. At all. Especially for my boss. I have been very unhappy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:47 AM",
      "text": "Ok lets chat when you're ready"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:47 AM",
      "text": "Good for you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:47 AM",
      "text": "Do you wanna talk or are you working?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:48 AM",
      "text": "Just call me whenever. It’s not urgent at all"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:48 AM",
      "text": "I’ll be around all day"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:48 AM",
      "text": "Work is crazy. Talk tonight or tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "11:48 AM",
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:48 AM",
      "text": "Sure"
    }
  ]
